`,r.jsx(u.p,{children:"I started out with Figma, putting into effect some ideas I’ve had for the design. I wanted my website to have two looks: a light theme and a dark theme, which can be switched by a lamp button in the navigation bar. For the light theme, I wanted it to have a more professional and calm look, matching tones of nature for the primary accents. To contrast, the dark theme explores more of my creative side, with funkier fonts and bright and glowy colors as primary accents. So, I ended up creating these style guides:"}),`
