`,r.jsx(u.p,{children:"After this, I worked on actually implementing my new dark and light themes. Thankfully, I had a good template with what I already had, so all I had to do was tweak the spacing, fonts, and colors. I also redesigned the navigation bar to have a glass-like background color and to include a hamburger menu to link to other pages within the site and, of course, the lamp button that picks the theme."}),`
